    "caption": "On April 28, we’ll explore how Korean companies scale from local markets to the global stage, which marketing strategies truly work today, and how AI is already transforming communications and brands in Korea.\n\nSpeaker - Kevin (Tae Hyun) Kim, Solution Creator, former Global Marketing Lead (Samsung, Hyundai, Korean Air), with 16 years of international experience in marketing and communications.\n\nWe’ll cover:\n✔️ growth logic of K-companies\n✔️ key industries and Korea’s competitive strengths\n✔️ modern marketing and AI trends\n✔️ potential synergy between Korea and Kazakhstan\n\n📅 April 28\n⏰ 17:30\n📍 Almaty Hub, Zenkov St. 24 (4th floor)\n\nThe session will be held in English.\nSeats are limited - registration required.\n\nRegistration link is in the bio: @almaty.hub.02",
